{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-25 19:31:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE MARCH 13, 2023 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 25, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-25 17:43:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 25, 2023) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER SOUTHWEST AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-25 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 13, 2023 - (NYSE: LUV)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF LUV DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT. APPOINTMENT AS LEAD PLAINTIFF IS NOT REQUIRED TO PARTAKE IN ANY RECOVERY.'}